	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: The paper states that missing values “were automatically imputed on a case-by-case basis in the XGBoost model,” which best fits algorithm handles natively. Class imbalance was addressed by setting scale_pos_weight = 7.8. Preprocessing included manual removal of post-transplant-only variables, one-hot encoding of categorical variables, numerical treatment of continuous/ordinal variables, and grid search tuning. The development and validation cohorts included 1,267 and 317 patients, respectively. No code-release statement was reported.  ￼

